1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:03,119
Five pounds of air pressure.

2
00:00:03,173 --> 00:00:05,317
One skyscraper.

3
00:00:05,337 --> 00:00:07,136
Down.

4
00:00:07,212 --> 00:00:11,404
1935. Tesla is 79.

5
00:00:11,539 --> 00:00:15,480
He tells reporters about a small oscillator.

6
00:00:15,577 --> 00:00:18,545
Clamped to a steel girder, he says,

7
00:00:18,606 --> 00:00:22,259
5 pounds of air pressure could bring down

8
00:00:22,356 --> 00:00:24,838
the Empire State Building.

9
00:00:24,952 --> 00:00:27,422
He tells another story.

10
00:00:27,548 --> 00:00:31,167
His lab on Houston Street starts to shake.

11
00:00:31,298 --> 00:00:34,801
The neighbors complain. The police arrive.

12
00:00:34,904 --> 00:00:37,913
He stops it with a sledgehammer.

13
00:00:37,933 --> 00:00:42,528
In 2006, a TV test rebuilt the idea.

14
00:00:42,548 --> 00:00:44,825
The verdict: busted.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,055
But the force behind it is real.

16
00:00:48,173 --> 00:00:53,225
1831. Soldiers march in step across a bridge.

17
00:00:53,365 --> 00:00:56,715
It starts to bounce. A bolt snaps.

18
00:00:56,827 --> 00:01:01,418
1940. Wind feeds the Tacoma Narrows Bridge

19
00:01:01,442 --> 00:01:03,996
until its deck tears apart.

20
00:01:04,038 --> 00:01:08,026
Every structure has a beat it wants to move to.

21
00:01:08,077 --> 00:01:10,938
Tremor asks the next question.

22
00:01:10,962 --> 00:01:12,838
Find that beat.

23
00:01:12,981 --> 00:01:15,262
Push exactly on it.

24
00:01:15,288 --> 00:01:17,617
Each push adds a little.

25
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:20,028
The sway keeps growing.

26
00:01:20,048 --> 00:01:23,604
8 drivers, bolted to the foundation.

27
00:01:23,654 --> 00:01:27,068
Tuned by laser to the building's sway.

28
00:01:27,115 --> 00:01:30,160
Trial one. A 10 m tower.

29
00:01:30,288 --> 00:01:32,088
Down.

30
00:01:32,163 --> 00:01:34,004
30 m.

31
00:01:34,038 --> 00:01:35,838
Down.

32
00:01:35,913 --> 00:01:37,802
60 m.

33
00:01:37,933 --> 00:01:39,733
Down.

34
00:01:40,385 --> 00:01:42,582
One side effect.

35
00:01:42,692 --> 00:01:45,747
Glass cracks for 3 blocks around.

36
00:01:46,010 --> 00:01:49,351
Tremor is cleared for demolition trials.

37
00:01:49,471 --> 00:01:52,659
Tesla needed 5 pounds of air.

38
00:01:52,788 --> 00:01:55,540
Tremor needs the right beat.
